# An ST warm reset before the user firmware runs: the menu again, after a new
# hello. After [F]irmware the sentinel keeps CMD_START, so a reset runs the
# user firmware again, as an app's emulation mode does, and only once per
# reset (an endless reset loop would show the user firmware's screen come and
# go: the screen is checked twice, 250 frames apart).
text "Atari +: (ST|STE|Mega STE), TOS" 1500
reset warm
newlog "Setting shared variable 1 to" 1500
text "Select an option" 500
key f
key 0x1c
screen same userfw 300
reset warm
newlog "Setting shared variable 1 to" 1500
screen same userfw 500
wait 250
screen same userfw 50
